  Possibly planted project folders

  These folders appeared while a non-admin Windows sandbox command ran, so a command may have
  planted them. Corbanu Terminal isn't loading their config, hooks or skills:
    project/.codex

  These .git folders appeared or changed while a non-admin Windows sandbox command ran, so a
  command may have planted them. Git runs their hooks and config outside the sandbox whenever you
  run git there:
    project/.git
  Check their contents before you load them.

› 1. Keep ignoring them  Ask again next time
  2. Load them           I checked them; load them from the next start

